{
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFD\\,#FAF2F9)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A191E\\,#221D26)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "{nm.y}+({nm.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#B4329B|#EE7FD6",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "_note": "源色身份点(组件设计系统 §2):每个组件恰好一次,y 锚在组件名的实测框上。"
      },
      {
        "id": "nm",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "21.0pt",
        "y": "11pt",
        "w": "88pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${p},${@i18n.noPkg})]",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),o),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "at",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "14pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24.0pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "alignmentH": "2",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${endM},--)]",
            "fontSize": "9pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "_note": "数据时间锚 = 数据截至日(MM-DD),不是取数时刻 —— 三个源都滞后 1~4 天,写取数时刻是在骗人。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),o),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "lab",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "31pt",
            "w": "134pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${ecoL},--)] · $[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),d),${@i18n.pushedV},if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),b),${@i18n.curV},${@i18n.latestV}))]",
            "fontSize": "10.5pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "_note": "Docker = 最近推送的版本 tag(不一定是最高版本,见 docker_ver);Homebrew = 当前版本(源不给发布日期)。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),o),0,if::(eq::(${hasV},1),if::(eq::(${vSz},0),1,0),0))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "ver0",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "46pt",
            "w": "134pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${verV}",
            "fontSize": "30pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),o),0,if::(eq::(${hasV},1),if::(eq::(${vSz},1),1,0),0))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "ver1",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "50.5pt",
            "w": "134pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${verV}",
            "fontSize": "24pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),o),0,if::(eq::(${hasV},1),if::(eq::(${vSz},2),1,0),0))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "ver2",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "54.5pt",
            "w": "134pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${verV}",
            "fontSize": "18pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),o),0,if::(eq::(${hasV},1),0,1))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "verN",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "46pt",
            "w": "134pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "30pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),o),0,if::(eq::(${hasR},1),if::(eq::(${relToday},1),0,1),0))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "ago",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "85pt",
            "w": "134pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${relAgo}$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),d),${@i18n.pAgo},if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),b),${@i18n.dAgo},${@i18n.dAgo}))] · ${relM}",
            "fontSize": "11pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "$[if::(eq::(${relNew},1),#B4329B|#EE7FD6,#6B7280|#8E939B)]"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),o),0,if::(eq::(${hasR},1),${relToday},0))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "agoT",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "85pt",
            "w": "134pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),d),${@i18n.pToday},if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),b),${@i18n.today},${@i18n.today}))]",
            "fontSize": "11pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#B4329B|#EE7FD6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),o),0,if::(eq::(${hasR},1),0,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),b),0,1)))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "agoN",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "85pt",
            "w": "134pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "11pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),o),0,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),b),1,0))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "agoB",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "85pt",
            "w": "134pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${@i18n.noDate}",
            "fontSize": "11pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ],
        "_note": "Homebrew 的 formula / cask JSON 只有版本号,没有发布时间 —— 如实写「未公开」,不拿统计生成日冒充。"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),o),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "tw",
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "112pt",
            "w": "134pt",
            "h": "34pt",
            "bgColor": "#E7E9EE|#20232A",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "10pt",
              "leftB": "10pt",
              "rightT": "10pt",
              "rightB": "10pt"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),o),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "twk",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "22.0pt",
            "y": "124pt",
            "w": "76pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),d),${@i18n.pullL},if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),b),${@i18n.i30L},${@i18n.wkS}))]",
            "fontSize": "9.5pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),o),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "twv",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "22.0pt",
            "y": "123pt",
            "w": "114pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "alignmentH": "2",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),findNotEmpty::(${wkZ},--),findNotEmpty::(${wkE},--))]",
            "fontSize": "12pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),o),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "offL",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "31pt",
            "w": "134pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${ecoL},Docker Hub)]",
            "fontSize": "10.5pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          },
          {
            "id": "offT",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "48pt",
            "w": "134pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "2",
            "text": "${@i18n.offT}",
            "fontSize": "16pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          }
        ],
        "_note": "大陆(@app.region = cn)不提供 Docker Hub:流不取数、kind=o。整卡只留包名与这句状态,用户的关注 / 组件参数不动。"
      }
    ],
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "dAgo": " 天前发布",
        "today": "今天发布",
        "noPkg": "还没选包",
        "latestV": "最新版本",
        "wkS": "近 7 天下载",
        "pullL": "累计拉取",
        "i30L": "近 30 天安装",
        "pushedV": "最近推送",
        "curV": "当前版本",
        "pAgo": " 天前推送",
        "pToday": "今天推送",
        "noDate": "发布日期未公开",
        "offT": "当前地区不提供"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "dAgo": "d ago",
        "today": "Released today",
        "noPkg": "No package",
        "latestV": "Latest version",
        "wkS": "Last 7 days",
        "pullL": "Total pulls",
        "i30L": "30d installs",
        "pushedV": "Last pushed",
        "curV": "Current",
        "pAgo": "d ago",
        "pToday": "Pushed today",
        "noDate": "No release date listed",
        "offT": "Not available in your region"
      }
    }
  }
}
